  m_Name: Note_BeamRotation1
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Beam Rotation Mechanism
  key: 3
  topic: 2
  boardContentText: Lighthouse rotational mechanism is located in the lighthouse's
    machinery floor
  boardSprite: {fileID: 0}
  contentText: "A man doesn't stray from the path. Between the supply dock and my
    shack, the world is just wide enough \u2013 and I had convinced myself that was
    enough. Eight years of the same stones underfoot, the same wind at my back. Eight
    years of knowing exactly where I belonged. And yet. One step off the gravel.
    Then another. The bushes gave way to a hidden path, the path to a ladder, the
    ladder to a room that had no right to exist.\_"
  paperSprite: {fileID: 0}
